  "notable_quotes": [
    "Single-crystal XRD shows compound 1 forms a 3D porous pillar-layer framework with 6-connected pcu topology in monoclinic P21/c.",
    "Compound 1 decomposes above 347 °C, and the final residue is assigned to ZnO (observed 36.02%, calculated 38.48%).",
    "TGA indicates an 8.12% mass loss at 110–145 °C from lattice water removal, while the desolvated framework remains stable up to 347 °C."
